        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/81ed2f11dd527ac08f4ead9250d102ea.avif?t=1781526183\" width=616 height=1425 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/f2edc52a27288b47ac3a12af72bc0c07.avif?t=1781526183\" width=630 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic choices, and climb through the amateur league to the first while making hard decisions to set everything in line for your club. Every choice matters and will affect future encounters. How will you decide on them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t<strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/de6d81a910998ee01fcac87fe4de773f.avif?t=1781526183\" width=608 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four main metrics in Regista: Fans, Money, Media and your Team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters, every single one of them will request something nonstop. It is important to keep all metrics in balance. When any of them reaches zero or hundred, you will lose control of that metric and either lose the game or be heavily punished by another metric.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > So, do not give total control to anyone. Play safe, sometimes make unwanted choices but survive through seasons to reach the top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/78012eaf83b22c9becd37ea61dba2c75.avif?t=1781526183\" width=625 height=116 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYour choices will affect everyone in your club from the bottom to the top. To stay in balance, you will make decisions even if you do not want to. Like firing your finance team or keeping your mouth shut about your players' actions to survive the season. Even risk your own reputation to keep the club intact. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/3fcf22fbad752b707c63d9bf52f825ca.avif?t=1781526183\" width=315 height=129 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/33491c72d48326153614f4d650a31d38.avif?t=1781526183\" width=558 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMake transfers, keep your team happy and aim for a flawless season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a season, you will encounter cards to improve your team's strength, morale and value. It is a risk and a mystery to always make the right decisions to gain that power or value your long-term gains and play safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/0873ceb60497aaa79fe0fbe6c43d1568.avif?t=1781526183\" width=539 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou will be in situations that sometimes need to end in your favour. Use your items to gain that leverage.<br><br>Like making a last-minute transfer to even the strength with your opponent or bribing the referee not to lose your win streak, you may even skip a card that you do not like the possible outcomes of. Lastly, to save your progress, you can boost a metric to have the balance in hand again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you choose?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/f2edc52a27288b47ac3a12af72bc0c07.avif?t=1781526183\" width=630 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic choices, and climb through the amateur league to the first while making hard decisions to set everything in line for your club. Every choice matters and will affect future encounters. How will you decide on them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t<strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/de6d81a910998ee01fcac87fe4de773f.avif?t=1781526183\" width=608 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four main metrics in Regista: Fans, Money, Media and your Team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters, every single one of them will request something nonstop. It is important to keep all metrics in balance. When any of them reaches zero or hundred, you will lose control of that metric and either lose the game or be heavily punished by another metric.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > So, do not give total control to anyone. Play safe, sometimes make unwanted choices but survive through seasons to reach the top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/78012eaf83b22c9becd37ea61dba2c75.avif?t=1781526183\" width=625 height=116 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYour choices will affect everyone in your club from the bottom to the top. To stay in balance, you will make decisions even if you do not want to. Like firing your finance team or keeping your mouth shut about your players' actions to survive the season. Even risk your own reputation to keep the club intact. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/3fcf22fbad752b707c63d9bf52f825ca.avif?t=1781526183\" width=315 height=129 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/33491c72d48326153614f4d650a31d38.avif?t=1781526183\" width=558 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMake transfers, keep your team happy and aim for a flawless season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a season, you will encounter cards to improve your team's strength, morale and value. It is a risk and a mystery to always make the right decisions to gain that power or value your long-term gains and play safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241940/extras/0873ceb60497aaa79fe0fbe6c43d1568.avif?t=1781526183\" width=539 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou will be in situations that sometimes need to end in your favour. Use your items to gain that leverage.<br><br>Like making a last-minute transfer to even the strength with your opponent or bribing the referee not to lose your win streak, you may even skip a card that you do not like the possible outcomes of. Lastly, to save your progress, you can boost a metric to have the balance in hand again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you choose?</p>",
